{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>長征十二號運載火箭今日（9日）凌晨4時24分在海南商業航天發射場，成功將衛星互聯網低軌29組衛星發射升空，衛星順利進入預定軌道，發射任務圓滿成功。（新華社）</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.424337+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":78,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T03:15:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T12:27:35.122936+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:40.319579+00:00","content_hash":"078dfbe805b0aa254a344dcdfc81b3c023028926fe360b12c54e104d8be9d255","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}